# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep local state out of a published image.
#
# `out/` and any profile other than the example are the two that matter: a run archive names your hosts,
# and a profile is a map of your infrastructure. Neither belongs in something pushed to a registry.

out/
profiles/*
!profiles/example.json
pool-*.json
journey*.json

node_modules/
gui/ui/dist/

# The documentation site: sources, build output and its Python virtualenv. The image
# serves the tool, not the docs.
docs/
site/
.venv-docs/
mkdocs.yml
__pycache__/

.git/
.github/
ci/
.claude/
graphify-out/
tests/
scripts/
Makefile
*.md
!cache-ab/README.md
.DS_Store
